# Architecture

```
                      AWS Systems Manager
                               │
                               │
                       Patch Manager Service
                               │
        ┌──────────────────────┴──────────────────────┐
        │                                             │
 Patch Baseline                              Maintenance Window
        │                                             │
        └──────────────────────┬──────────────────────┘
                               │
                       AWS Run Command
                               │
                 AWS-RunPatchBaseline Document
                               │
                    Managed Amazon EC2 Instance
                               │
                   Ubuntu Package Manager (APT)
                               │
                  Scan / Install Operating System Updates
                               │
                     Patch Compliance & Reporting
```

