# Prerequisites

Before starting this lab, ensure that:

- Ubuntu EC2 instance is running.
- AWS Systems Manager Agent (SSM Agent) is installed.
- EC2 instance has an IAM Role attached.
- Instance appears as a **Managed Node** in AWS Systems Manager.
- Internet connectivity (or Systems Manager VPC Endpoints) is available.
- AWS CLI is configured if command-line verification is required.

